iv class=\"salutation\">Dear Mr. Ahearn:</div>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph intro\">\n        As you know, negotiations are getting underway for Chile to join the North American Free Trade Agreement. &nbsp;President Clinton and the other Nafta nations made the invitation last December.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph\">\n        Edelman is handling Chile’s communications activities in the United States, and I want to let you know that we can be of assistance when you prepare stories on the upcoming negotiations. &nbsp;We can provide you with a broad range of information on Chile such as media kits and interview opportunities with Chilean officials.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph\">\n        It is important to keep in mind why the Nafta nations selected Chile as their first Latin American partner:\n      </p>\n\n      <ul class=\"list\">\n        <li>Chile’s economy has undergone dramatic reform and is one of the most open and advanced in Latin America;</li>\n        <li>Chile can serve as a key building block in expanding economic reforms and more open trade throughout the hemisphere;</li>\n        <li>Chile is a proven investment partner for the U.S.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"closing\">\n        Please feel free to contact me if I can be of any assistance. &nbsp;My phone number is 202-371-0200.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sincerely\">Sincerely,</div>\n\n      <div class=\"signature-placeholder\" aria-label=\"Signature placeholder\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"signatory\">Jeffrey M. Surrell</div>\n\n      <div class=\"stamp-placeholder\" aria-label=\"Partially legible stamp\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"footer-row\">\n        Atlanta&nbsp;&nbsp; Chicago&nbsp;&nbsp; Dallas&nbsp;&nbsp; Houston&nbsp;&nbsp; Los Angeles&nbsp;&nbsp; Louisville&nbsp;&nbsp; New York&nbsp;&nbsp; Sacramento&nbsp;&nbsp; San Francisco&nbsp;&nbsp; Silicon Valley&nbsp;&nbsp; Washington\n      </div>\n      <d